# Project environment

1. `.venv` is disposable — never commit or snapshot it.
2. Dev dependencies live in `pyproject.toml` dependency groups + committed `uv.lock`.
3. Canonical maintainer Python is `3.14.6` via `.python-version`.
4. Python download only via `python3 scripts/project_environment.py bootstrap --allow-python-download`.
5. Normal checks use `uv run --python 3.14.6 --locked --no-sync --offline --no-python-downloads`.
6. Do not mutate project `.venv` with manual `pip install`.
7. Product runtime does not require `uv`.
